{"3968280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Devoid of light", "steam_appid": 3968280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devoid of Light is a fast-paced time-survival game with rogue lite elements, designed to keep you constantly on the move. In a world where every creature hungers for warmth, a single fading light holds back the darkness. Defend your core against relentless hordes, fight your way through the depths of the underworld, and uncover a path to the next level. But beware—run out of time, and the All-Seer will decide your fate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light of your core is limited and enemies lurk in the dark. Be on the lookout for waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968280/extras/402e293fd3384b014256d32398a1ca0d.avif?t=1764353829\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find chests dropped from defeated enemies that will grant you further battle capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968280/extras/b611d7ec2016b446dcc6b26a3305fa1e.avif?t=1764353829\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze your surroundings and pick a character suited for the task at hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968280/extras/a7a3e7bea8272005ac77f82e0b6bd28e.avif?t=1764353829\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk life and light to gather gold and gems to upgrade your characters abilities! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968280/extras/0c2f601e36673b3d0fd4e8683df42dc7.avif?t=1764353829\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Evolve to survive</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These screenshots showcase actual gameplay using temporary and placeholder art. The final version will contain polished assets</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports mouse and keyboard</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devoid of Light is a fast-paced time-survival game with rogue lite elements, designed to keep you constantly on the move. In a world where every creature hungers for warmth, a single fading light holds back the darkness. Defend your core against relentless hordes, fight your way through the depths of the underworld, and uncover a path to the next level. But beware—run out of time, and the All-Seer will decide your fate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light of your core is limited and enemies lurk in the dark. Be on the lookout for waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968280/extras/402e293fd3384b014256d32398a1ca0d.avif?t=1764353829\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find chests dropped from defeated enemies that will grant you further battle capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968280/extras/b611d7ec2016b446dcc6b26a3305fa1e.avif?t=1764353829\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze your surroundings and pick a character suited for the task at hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968280/extras/a7a3e7bea8272005ac77f82e0b6bd28e.avif?t=1764353829\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >